## LEGEND

| Symbol | Level | AI Behavior |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| 🔴 | **MANDATORY** | Must ALWAYS apply. No exceptions. |
| 🟡 | **IMPORTANT** | Apply in most cases. Rare exceptions possible. |
| 🟢 | **RECOMMENDED** | Apply when possible. Flexible. |

