## 0. FILE ENCODING

🔴 **Use UTF-8 with BOM for all text files:** C#, Markdown, JSON, scripts, AI
rules, wiki pages, raw project docs, and generated documentation.

🔴 **Why:** BOM keeps Russian text and Markdown/JSON content stable across
Windows, Unity, Obsidian, older PowerShell/.NET tooling, and mixed editors.

```powershell
[System.IO.File]::WriteAllText($path, $content, (New-Object System.Text.UTF8Encoding($true)))
```

