## 9. COMMENTS & DOCUMENTATION

🔴 **XML docs for all public classes, methods, properties (in English):**
```csharp
/// <summary>
/// Controls the health of the game character.
/// </summary>
public class HealthController : MonoBehaviour
{
    /// <summary>
    /// Applies damage to the character.
    /// </summary>
