🔴 **Document code in English.** Exception: enum `<summary>` tags may be in Russian for designers.

🔴 **Inline comments with `//`** for non-obvious logic:
```csharp
// Check if player is grounded before allowing jump
bool isGrounded = Physics.Raycast(transform.position, Vector3.down, 0.1f);
```

🟢 **Group multi-condition explanations above the block:**
```csharp
// Jump conditions:
// 1. Player is grounded
// 2. Jump button pressed
// 3. Player has enough stamina

if (isGrounded && Input.GetButtonDown("Jump") && stamina > JUMP_COST)
{
    Jump();
}
