```

🟢 **Prefer `async/await` (UniTask) over coroutines for complex sequences:**
```csharp
public async UniTaskVoid LoadLevelAsync()
{
    isLoading = true;
    await SceneManager.LoadSceneAsync("Level1").ToUniTask();
    await InitializeGameState();
    isLoading = false;
}
```

### UnityEvent
🔴 **NEVER use `UnityEvent`. Use standard C# events or KBPro EventBus:**
```csharp
// ❌ FORBIDDEN
[SerializeField] private UnityEvent _onComplete;

// ✅ Correct — C# event
public event Action OnComplete;

// ✅ Correct — KBPro EventBus
EventBus<EventGameEnd>.Raise(new EventGameEnd { Result = GameResult.Victory });
```

### Addressables
🔴 **Use Addressables instead of `Resources.Load`:**
```csharp
// ✅
AsyncOperationHandle<GameObject> handle =
    Addressables.LoadAssetAsync<GameObject>($"enemies/{enemyId}");
await handle.ToUniTask();

// ❌
Resources.Load<GameObject>($"Enemies/{enemyId}");
