## 8. MEMORY & PERFORMANCE

🔴 **No allocations in `Update()`.** Pre-allocate and reuse:
```csharp
// ❌
private void Update()
{
    List<Enemy> enemies = new List<Enemy>(); // allocates every frame!
}

// ✅
private List<Enemy> _enemiesCache = new List<Enemy>();
private void Update()
{
    _enemiesCache.Clear();
    // reuse cache
}
```

🔴 **Release all resources and unsubscribe events in `OnDestroy`:**
```csharp
private void OnDestroy()
{
    if (renderTexture != null)
    {
        renderTexture.Release();
        renderTexture = null;
    }
    EventManager.OnGameOver -= HandleGameOver;
}
```

🟢 **Use `struct` for small temporary data types** (no GC allocation):
```csharp
public struct DamageInfo
{
    public float Amount;
    public DamageType Type;
    public Vector3 Source;
}
```

🟢 **Cache `Shader.PropertyToID` as static readonly:**
```csharp
private static readonly int MainColorID = Shader.PropertyToID("_Color");
private static readonly int EmissionColorID = Shader.PropertyToID("_EmissionColor");
```

