```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Flow as ChippedCrownFlowSystem
    participant Sys as ChippedCrownToothShapingStageSystem
    participant Inst as InstrumentsComponent
    participant Drill as DrillModel
    participant Tooth as ChippedCrownBoneToothModel

    Flow->>Sys: StartStage(config, teeth, callback)
