[StateMachine] Transition: Entry → excavation (Screen: Loading, SourceAction: Destroy)
[StateMachine] Load module: excavation (0.8s)
[StateMachine] Initialize module: excavation (0.2s)
[StateMachine] Start module: excavation
[StateMachine] Transition: excavation → foundation (Condition: on_complete)
[StateMachine] Suspend module: excavation
[StateMachine] Load module: foundation (0.5s)
